---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How It Works | CivicConnect" description="Understand the technology and verified pipeline behind CivicConnect's answers.">
  <div class="py-24 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <span class="text-caption-mono text-mute tracking-[0.15em] block mb-3">methodology</span>
      <h1 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-6">How CivicConnect Works</h1>
      <p class="text-body-lg text-mute leading-relaxed">
        A structured, reliable system designed to verify every answer against official legal acts and government schemes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Steps -->
    <div class="space-y-16 relative before:absolute before:top-4 before:bottom-4 before:left-8 before:w-[1px] before:bg-hairline">
      
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="relative pl-16">
        <div class="absolute left-[20px] top-[4px] w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-canvas border-2 border-accent-sunset flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-sunset"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-caption-mono text-accent-sunset tracking-wider block mb-2">step 1</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-xs text-ink mb-3">Ask in Plain Language</h2>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-mute leading-relaxed">
          Type your query into the assistant composer just like you would describe a problem to a friend. For example: *"How do I register a birth in Maharashtra?"* or *"What is the landholding limit for the PM-Kisan scheme?"*
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="relative pl-16">
        <div class="absolute left-[20px] top-[4px] w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-canvas border-2 border-accent-breeze flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-breeze"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-caption-mono text-accent-breeze tracking-wider block mb-2">step 2</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-xs text-ink mb-3">Retrieve Verified Source Documents</h2>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-mute leading-relaxed">
          The system searches indexed, official documents matching your selected jurisdiction (Central or State). It retrieves the exact sections of relevant legislation, official rules, or scheme manuals.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="relative pl-16">
        <div class="absolute left-[20px] top-[4px] w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-canvas border-2 border-accent-dusk flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-dusk"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-caption-mono text-accent-dusk tracking-wider block mb-2">step 3</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-xs text-ink mb-3">Generate Context-Bound Explanations</h2>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-mute leading-relaxed">
          An AI assistant reads the retrieved source documents and draft-generates a clear, simplified summary response. The model is constrained to write *only* what is supported by the facts in the retrieved documents, preventing common AI errors.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="relative pl-16">
        <div class="absolute left-[20px] top-[4px] w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-canvas border-2 border-primary flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="text-caption-mono text-ink tracking-wider block mb-2">step 4</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-xs text-ink mb-3">Cross-Verify & Render Citations</h2>
        <p class="text-body-sm text-mute leading-relaxed">
          Every statement is cross-matched back to the source text. The interface displays verified badges indicating the specific Act Name, Section, and official link. You can open the details drawer to view the exact excerpt from the law.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Call to action -->
    <div class="mt-20 p-8 border border-hairline bg-canvas-card rounded-sm text-center">
      <h3 class="text-display-xs text-ink mb-4">Experience the Interface</h3>
      <p class="text-body-sm text-mute mb-6 max-w-md mx-auto">
        Test our verified citation workflow inside the active assistant panel.
      </p>
      <a href="/assistant" class="button-pill button-pill-outline text-caption-mono tracking-wider">
        open assistant dashboard
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
